Subject: [PATCH] Profile::GetMesg: model rewrite accepted by the search
 (generation 2)

Provenance: greedy search, seed 4, generation 2, region 574 (Profile::GetMesg).
Generated by the model (deepseek-v4.1-flash); not hand-written. Search-time ratio R (candidate/stock, <1 is faster): 1.0000 -> 0.9307 at acceptance (max of two measurements). This is a ranking value, NOT an independent per-patch
confirmation; only the fixed FINAL patch of the run was re-measured independently.
Cumulative patch it was derived from: runs/deepseek/greedy-s4-1072871/patches/gen_2.patch (diff against stock; do not apply together with the others).
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fit_profile.cpp | 14 ++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/fit_profile.cpp b/src/fit_profile.cpp
index d7551dd..4898475 100644
--- a/src/fit_profile.cpp
+++ b/src/fit_profile.cpp
@@ -3057,13 +3057,19 @@ const Profile::MESG Profile::mesgs[MESGS] =
 
 const Profile::MESG* Profile::GetMesg(const FIT_UINT16 num)
 {
-    for (int i = 0; i < MESGS; i++)
+    static const Profile::MESG* table[65536] = {};
+    static bool initialized = false;
+
+    if (!initialized)
     {
-        if (mesgs[i].num == num)
-            return &mesgs[i];
+        for (int i = static_cast<int>(MESGS) - 1; i >= 0; --i)
+        {
+            table[mesgs[i].num] = &mesgs[i];
+        }
+        initialized = true;
     }
 
-    return NULL;
+    return table[num];
 }
 
 const Profile::MESG* Profile::GetMesg(const std::string& name)
